#: templates/about.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Paulina invites you to learn about the cultural heritage of humanity. It "
"is a multilingual tool, powered by %(wikidata_link)s, that allows you to "
"search for people and find out if they have freely accessible works in "
"the public domain. It also facilitates the understanding of copyright "
"terms and helps to know when a work enters the public domain in each "
"country."
msgstr ""
"Paulina invitate conocer el padremuñu cultural de la humanidá. Ye una "
"ferramienta multillingüe, impulsada por %(wikidata_link)s, que te permite"
" guetar persones y saber si tienen obres d'accesu llibre nel dominiu "
"públicu. Tamién facilita la comprensión de los plazos de copyright y aida"
" saber cuándo una obra entra nel dominiu públicu en cada país."

#: templates/about.html:21
msgid ""
"Paulina is fed by data from Wikidata, the free and collaborative database"
" maintained by the Wikimedia Foundation."
msgstr ""
"Paulina aliméntase de datos dende Wikidata, la base de datos llibre y "
"collaborativa mantenida pola Fundación Wikimedia."

#: templates/about.html:22
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the information consulted may contain errors or be incomplete."
" Paulina helps to identify gaps and inaccuracies in information about "
"cultural heritage and invites you to improve the data in Wikidata and, "
"through it, on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Dacuando, la información consultada pue tener errores o tar incompleta. "
"Paulina aida identificar llacunes ya inexactitudes na información sobre'l"
" padremuñu cultural ya invita a ameyorar los datos en Wikidata y, al "
"traviés d'ella, na Internet."

#: templates/about.html:23
msgid "Local tools"
msgstr "Ferramientes llocales"

#: templates/about.html:24
msgid ""
"This website is part of a larger project to facilitate the creation of "
"national, regional or thematic versions of the tool, according to the "
"needs of each community."
msgstr ""
"Esta páxina web forma parte d'un proyeutu más ampliu pa facilitar la "
"creación de versiones nacionales, rexonales o temátiques de la "
"ferramienta, según les necesidaes de cada comunidá."

